# Build-context minimization + secret hygiene [SWIFT-UG-SEC-01].
# Both Dockerfiles `COPY . .` from the repo root; nothing below may enter a
# builder layer or remote-builder cache. The runtime stages copy only built
# artifacts, but builder layers persist in caches — keep secrets out entirely.

.git
.github

# Secrets & local env — images get configuration at runtime, never baked in
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

# Local data that must never enter an image: KYC uploads, internal reports
uploads
**/uploads
reports
design
CLAUDE.md
RESKIN.md

# Dependencies & host build artifacts (rebuilt inside the image)
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
coverage
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# Heavy native/mobile artifacts irrelevant to server images
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/.expo
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target

# Noise
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.log
.vscode
.idea
